{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-02-17 08:00:00', 'title': 'IBM LAUNCHES 2-YEAR GLOBAL PRO BONO ENVIRONMENTAL PROGRAM FOR NON-PROFITS', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., FEB. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IBM (NYSE:\xa0IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE IBM SUSTAINABILITY ACCELERATOR , A GLOBAL PRO BONO SOCIAL IMPACT PROGRAM THAT APPLIES IBM TECHNOLOGIES, SUCH AS HYBRID CLOUD AND ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, AND AN ECOSYSTEM OF EXPERTS TO ENHANCE AND SCALE NON-PROFIT AND GOVERNMENT ORGANIZATION\xa0OPERATIONS, FOCUSED ON POPULATIONS VULNERABLE TO ENVIRONMENTAL THREATS INCLUDING CLIMATE CHANGE, EXTREME WEATHER, AND POLLUTION.'}